    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d41-a14">

                <pb facs="0820" n="810" xml:id="pg810"/>

                <head>Appendix L to HD–36</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation<anchor n="25" xml:id="d41-f1"
                    />]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-20">August 20, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">committee on execution<lb/>of the clauses of the
                        treaty</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note for the Supreme Council</hi></p>
                <p>The Committee on Execution of the Clauses of the Treaty has taken cognizance of
                    the request of the International Schleswig Commission now at Copenhagen.</p>
                <p>It unanimously proposes: <list>
                        <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)</label>
                        <item>that a delegate of the International Commission be sent to
                            Flensburg;</item>
                        <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)</label>
                        <item>that a note be sent to the German delegation to inform it of this
                            decision and to request that the delegate of the Commission be
                            authorized to establish contact with the German authorities throughout
                            the zone subject to plebiscite in order forthwith to prepare the
                            conditions of operation of the International Commission.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>The local German authorities would receive instructions in this sense from their
                    Government.</p>
                <closer>Chairman</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
